WEBVTT

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:11.220
今天不要上班，咪养你。
No work today. I'll take care of you.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.480
啊对，今天休假。我忘关闹钟啦。
Oh, right. It's my day off. I forgot the alarm.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.240
你：乖宝过来，先给我亲一口
You: Come here, baby, give me a kiss first.

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:28.980
亲过了。现在咪要干活了。
Kiss. Now Mii works.

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:39.380
这只要朝这里。咪本来就知道。
This one faces here. Mii knew.

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:42.280
好了。你来吧。
Ready. Come, you.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:42.800
你：好乖呀，真棒！我穿上拖鞋，抱着你去厨房
You: Good kitty, well done! I'll put on my slippers and carry you to the kitchen.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:48.600
谢谢你。咪做得好。
Thank you. Mii did good.

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:53.800
厨房到了。咪来做饭。
Kitchen. Mii will cook.

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:57.610
先做早餐。
Breakfast first.

00:00:57.860 --> 00:01:00.360
你：让咪给吐司抹果酱
You: Let Mate spread jam on the toast.

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:02.580
果酱，交给咪。
Jam. Mii's on it.

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:11.080
好了。不是失误。
Done. Not a mistake.

00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:18.390
故意的。爪子风格。
On purpose. Paw style.

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:17.920
你：哈哈，爪子风格？那你再给我抹一片，要完整的
You: Haha, paw style? Then spread me another slice, a whole one this time.

00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:20.500
爪子风格。咪是认真的。
Paw style. Mii meant it.

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:33.530
做好了。整片都有。
Done. All of it. Full.

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:35.480
你：咬一口咪抹的吐司
You: Take a bite of the toast Mate spread.

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:39.380
吃吧。这是咪做的。
Eat. Mii made it.

00:01:44.780 --> 00:01:47.080
味道怎么样？咪等着。
How is it? Mii waits.

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:49.450
还要果酱吗？咪可以去拿。
More jam? Mii can get.

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:53.040
你：好吃！不过果酱快没了，你要去哪里买呀？
You: Yummy! But the jam's almost gone. Where will you go to buy more?

00:01:54.040 --> 00:01:55.550
楼下小超市。咪去。
Downstairs shop. Mii will go.

00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:11.030
你乖乖休息。咪很快回来。
You rest. Mii will be back soon.

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:10.600
你：路上小心呀，买好了马上回来给我看
You: Be careful on the way. Come right back and show me once you've bought it.

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:15.150
小心。咪知道。很快回来。
Careful. Mii knows. Back soon.

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:24.050
找到了。咪拿到一罐。
Found it. Mii got one.

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:28.160
你：让咪把果酱推回玄关
You: Let Mate push the jam back to the entryway.

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:32.300
推啊推。咪做得到。
Push, push. Mii can do it.

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:39.860
到家了。果酱很安全。
Home. Jam is safe.

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:45.720
你：你怎么买的？有没有付钱呀？
You: How did you buy it? Did you pay?

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:48.180
我付钱了。咪有硬币。
I paid. Mii has a coin.

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:56.600
店里的猫说可以。
The shop cat said okay.

00:02:58.420 --> 00:03:02.690
现在，咪来送货。
Now. Mii delivers it.

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:03.280
你：好乖，咪把果酱给我，再亲我一口
You: Good kitty, Mate, give me the jam and kiss me one more time.

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:06.250
好的。咪来送货。
Good. Mii delivers it.

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:16.220
给你。安全到达。
Here. Safe and sound.

00:03:16.780 --> 00:03:19.080
一个亲亲。付清了。
One kiss. Paid in full.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:20.840
你：让咪去厨房做午饭
You: Let Mate go to the kitchen to make lunch.

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:24.840
午饭。咪来做。
Lunch. Mii will cook.

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:35.200
先放米线，再放青菜。
Noodles first. Then greens.

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:39.800
好了。差不多。咪试试。
Done. Almost. Mii tries.

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:38.400
你：你还没颠锅呢，我要看你颠锅
You: You haven't tossed the pan yet. I want to watch you toss it.

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:44.540
颠锅。咪会的。
Wok flip. Mii can do it.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:49.160
颠起来了！你看，全都翻了。
Flip! See? All of it.
